---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Study Notes — LLM Architecture Atlas" active="notes">
  <section class="notes-head">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="notes.eyebrow">Architecture Research Notes</p>
    <h1 data-i18n="notes.title">Study Notes</h1>
    <p class="lede" data-i18n="notes.subtitle">
      Self-contained technical research briefs and hand-drawn engineering decks backed by source code and pinned model configurations.
    </p>
  </section>

  <ul class="notes-grid">
    <li class="note-card">
      <div class="note-top">
        <span class="pill pill-state" data-i18n-en="Hand-Drawn Deck · 13 Slides" data-i18n-zh="手绘风单页报告 · 13 页">Hand-Drawn Deck · 13 Slides</span>
        <span class="note-date mono">2026-11-27</span>
      </div>
      <h2>
        <a
          href="/llm-architecture-atlas/notes/engram-v41/index.html"
          data-i18n-en="Engram Conditional Memory & DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 Engineering Analysis"
          data-i18n-zh="Engram 条件记忆机制与 DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 工程落地笔记"
        >
          Engram Conditional Memory & DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 Engineering Analysis
        </a>
      </h2>
      <p
        class="note-summary"
        data-i18n-en="Structured via First-Principles 9-step framework: Goal/Constraints, candidate trade-offs, Apache-2.0 paper figures, interactive V4.1 SVG explorer, 5-step walkthrough, controlled 27B eval, and remaining gaps."
        data-i18n-zh="按「目标→问题→事实×约束→选型取舍→实现归因→受控验证→差距→突破」9 步推演，附论文原图、V4.1 交互 SVG 结构图与 5 步实例动画。"
      >
        Structured via First-Principles 9-step framework: Goal/Constraints, candidate trade-offs, Apache-2.0 paper figures, interactive V4.1 SVG explorer, 5-step walkthrough, controlled 27B eval, and remaining gaps.
      </p>
      <div class="note-foot">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/llm-architecture-atlas/notes/engram-v41/index.html" data-i18n="notes.openDeck">Open Hand-Drawn Deck →</a>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>
</Base>

<style>
  .notes-head {
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--attention);
  }
  .notes-head h1 {
    margin: 0 0 0.55rem;
    font-size: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }
  .lede {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 52rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .notes-grid {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(22rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  .note-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.35rem;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--panel);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }
  .note-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .note-date {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .note-card h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.18rem;
    line-height: 1.38;
  }
  .note-card h2 a {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .note-card h2 a:hover {
    color: var(--attention);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .note-summary {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.58;
  }
  .note-foot {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 0.45rem;
  }
</style>
